### Actualizar referencia
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "LocationId": 4138,
  "LocationName": "Bodega Central (Actualizada)",
  "LocationAddress": "Zona 2, Ciudad de Guatemala",
  "PrivateCode": "BG-NEW",
  "Latitude": 14.6450,
  "Longitude": -90.5050,
  "Radius": 100,
  "LocationClassId": 30,
  "Membership": {
    "CustomerId": 2,
    "OrganizationId": 1,
    "DivisionId": null,
    "SubdivisionId": null,
    "CustomerPrivateCode": null,
    "OrganizationPrivateCode": null,
    "DivisionPrivateCode": null,
    "SubdivisionPrivateCode": null
  }
}
### WD-2104: mover una referencia existente a otras coordenadas
### Solo lat/lng; el resto de los campos se conserva.
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "LocationId": 4138,
  "LocationName": "Bodega Central (Actualizada)",
  "Latitude": 14.6500,
  "Longitude": -90.5100,
  "Membership": {
    "CustomerId": 2
  }
}

### WD-2104: update sin coordenadas ni radio
### Conserva lat/lng/radius actuales de la referencia.
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "LocationId": 4138,
  "LocationName": "Bodega Central (solo nombre)",
  "Membership": {
    "CustomerId": 2
  }
}

### WD-2104: solo latitud → 400
### Esperado: "Latitude and Longitude must be provided together".
POST {{baseUrl}}/Location/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "LocationId": 4138,
  "LocationName": "Bodega Central (Actualizada)",
  "Latitude": 14.6500,
  "Membership": {
    "CustomerId": 2
  }
}
